        desc = "Word at record offset 0x28 (node 0x262C + idx*44). SetCover1: R/W, clears 0x1FFFFFFF or written whole (0xFFFFFFFF constant path); 29-bit value (INFERRED: quadrilateral cover parameter). Provenance: offset/stride PROVEN, masks/shifts PROVEN (lower bounds), meaning INFERRED.";
        field {
